itdunit‚dmarkf200000ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;x1sptIBSnMvBMc-Zo-aSSaS1OlniIJeoSIy3ODBDbAwƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarki0.4111656ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;krvFojDeLX1J-MTgFo483r96douvKGVlzpPF0Pg5648ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarka3ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;gf_QmYfVFYtcg5n2rPRx1oMpBmkZW6agP_W9lX2FUnQƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarke32000ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;6owszJDX5qsz7YHvvNcCLvJETIVW4ng5i2OFo-4YwJIƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarke16754ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;gFlqSeU6vIRsxkAMzTVarzPUl0OLqtZm6tkezoQs7_wƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarka0ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;m9uQPOChzzx2XkBvZDrA6n-hlkfqnURxHPSoNkCwWEUƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarka1ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;xoCYsSa8hSiyMShlYrDhNWziNEKJWPexG08QHrR-i_Mƒdpairƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;1V1qHoqOtAtPCJ392Tr8QtVFCuv3HgzHo7xJX3g5Tb4ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkyŞThe first stretch of the 2026 NBA Summer League in Las Vegas has placed Yaxel Lendeborg in sharp focus, with Bay Area News Group's Shae Hammond [reporting what those games have revealed](https://www.chicoer.com/2026/07/18/what-weve-learned-about-yaxel-lendeborg-from-warriors-summer-league/) about the Golden State Warriors' newest forward.

Lendeborg was selected by Golden State in the 2026 NBA draft, from a class that many observers labeled pro-ready, [per Hammond](https://www.chicoer.com/2026/07/18/what-weve-learned-about-yaxel-lendeborg-from-warriors-summer-league/). He is a 6-foot-9, 241-pound forward who logged six collegiate seasons and entered the league with what the report describes as a diverse skillset. The most consequential question following him into Las Vegas concerned his three-point shooting â€” a question his time at UAB had left unresolved.

**Golden State advances in Las Vegas**

Golden State moved through the Las Vegas Summer League at 3-1 and edged the Lakers 92-88 in a playoff-round matchup to reach the semifinals, [Hammond reported](https://www.chicoer.com/2026/07/18/what-weve-learned-about-yaxel-lendeborg-from-warriors-summer-league/). The Warriors also beat Memphis 106-85 in a Tuesday game, the same source notes. Lendeborg contributed to the run: he scored 16 points in one outing while LJ Cryer, Ike, and Graham filled rotation spots alongside him, [per Hammond](https://www.chicoer.com/2026/07/18/what-weve-learned-about-yaxel-lendeborg-from-warriors-summer-league/), and in a second contest put up 15 points with four assists, two rebounds, and three blocks, [according to the report](https://www.chicoer.com/2026/07/18/what-weve-learned-about-yaxel-lendeborg-from-warriors-summer-league/).

**The shooting case**

Lendeborg entered the professional game carrying a non-shooter reputation that took root during his first two seasons at UAB, [Hammond reported](https://www.chicoer.com/2026/07/18/what-weve-learned-about-yaxel-lendeborg-from-warriors-summer-league/). His final three collegiate seasons complicated that picture, the source notes: his three-point percentage over that span reached 37%, enough to prompt a genuine question about whether the original label still applied.

The summer league games have offered additional evidence. In two California Classic contests, Lendeborg connected on 7 of 9 attempts from beyond the arc, [per Hammond](https://www.chicoer.com/2026/07/18/what-weve-learned-about-yaxel-lendeborg-from-warriors-summer-league/). Across all summer league play, he has made 15 of 31 attempts â€” an admittedly small sample, [the report states](https://www.chicoer.com/2026/07/18/what-weve-learned-about-yaxel-lendeborg-from-warriors-summer-league/), but one the source describes as striking. Early returns suggest the shooting threat is credible, [Hammond wrote](https://www.chicoer.com/2026/07/18/what-weve-learned-about-yaxel-lendeborg-from-warriors-summer-league/).

Hammond's account describes Lendeborg's role as a catch-and-shoot wing specialist using compact mechanics from the corners and off the perimeter. His name appeared alongside De'Anthony Melton and Steph Curry in the discussion of what type of shooting wing he might develop into, [per the same report](https://www.chicoer.com/2026/07/18/what-weve-learned-about-yaxel-lendeborg-from-warriors-summer-league/). On an NBC broadcast during the summer league run, Lendeborg expressed the goal of bringing the best results home to the Bay Area, [according to Hammond](https://www.chicoer.com/2026/07/18/what-weve-learned-about-yaxel-lendeborg-from-warriors-summer-league/).

**Rotation stakes heading into the regular season**

The results carry weight because the Warriors face meaningful absences. With Jimmy Butler and Moses Moody among players carrying knee injuries expected to affect the 2026-27 roster, Lendeborg is projected to handle large portions of Steve Kerr's rotation, [Hammond reported](https://www.chicoer.com/2026/07/18/what-weve-learned-about-yaxel-lendeborg-from-warriors-summer-league/). The report notes that summer league is not a complete indicator of NBA readiness â€” and with seven games now in the books, several questions about the Warriors' present composition and the forward's place in it remain unanswered, [per Hammond](https://www.chicoer.com/2026/07/18/what-weve-learned-about-yaxel-lendeborg-from-warriors-summer-league/). Whether the shooting production holds as the level of competition rises is the most consequential question still facing Lendeborg and the team as their Las Vegas run continues.ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;q8d_9FXsMyQ8UgVrYK6SoLnt0oGqcoXaPIhA7lKmyJUƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx$7ae5ccc6-367c-4525-b4f0-6d24e91dcfe0ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;oZ-L01L6i-JaZdNU4J2DjySFgGP8ssWVmpQZ5eTA11Qƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkhend_turnƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;rFzLiOfx2dnKceL8i1C1kNIkQ3ulFnVutpYFU-l_5BEƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkgsuccessƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;nTAK2kxNmsC5RQoPDqnZvqhI84HbXo_iy0rTn7Tp8Mwƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkicompletedƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;N87rLK7RjSQWEDAaZrPBkXZ6nbYEtLsipBvuhfm4Ko4ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkb64ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;Ru6